{'symbol': 'DLTR', 'date': '2022-09-26 07:35:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR TREE, INC. NAMES MICHAEL CREEDON AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER', 'text': "CHESAPEAKE, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DOLLAR TREE, INC. (NASDAQ: DLTR) TODAY ANNOUNCED A KEY EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP ADDITION, AS MICHAEL CREEDON, JR. WILL BE JOINING THE ORGANIZATION AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER. “I AM EXTREMELY PLEASED TO ANNOUNCE THAT MIKE CREEDON WILL BE JOINING THE DOLLAR TREE TEAM AS OUR NEW CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER. MIKE'S IMPRESSIVE CAREER IN RETAIL IS ROOTED IN A DEEP KNOWLEDGE AND UNDERSTANDING OF HIS CUSTOMERS,” STATED MIKE WITYNSKI, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. “MIK"}